---
// Set 07: Knight's gross position over the 45 minutes if built at an even pace (SEC totals: $3.5B long + $3.15B short = $6.65B in about 2,700 s).
const W = 580;
const H = 280;
const x0 = 60, x1 = 540, y0 = 220, y1 = 60;
---
<div class="qs13c">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-hidden="true">
    <text x="12" y="24" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Gross position built, even pace over 45 minutes</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Vị thế gộp đã dựng, nhịp đều trong 45 phút</tspan>
    </text>
    <line x1={x0} x2={x1} y1={y0} y2={y0} class="axis" />
    <line x1={x0} x2={x0} y1={y0} y2={y1 - 10} class="axis" />
    <line x1={x0} x2={x1} y1={y0} y2={y1} class="trend" />
    <circle cx={x1} cy={y1} r="5" class="dot" />
    <text x={x1} y={y1 - 12} text-anchor="end" class="l">
      <tspan data-lang-en>$6.65 billion at 2,700 s</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>6,65 tỷ USD ở giây 2.700</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={x0 + 4} y={y0 + 20} class="s">0</text>
    <text x={x1} y={y0 + 20} text-anchor="end" class="s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>45 minutes</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>45 phút</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={x0 + 10} y={y1 + 8} class="s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>$3.5B long + $3.15B short</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>3,5 tỷ mua + 3,15 tỷ bán khống</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="12" y="262" class="s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Even pace is an assumption: the real flow was not even.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Nhịp đều là giả định: dòng lệnh thật không đều.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>
<style>
  .qs13c { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qs13c svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .qs13c .h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qs13c .s { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qs13c .l { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qs13c .axis { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qs13c .trend { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.5; }
  .qs13c .dot { fill: var(--red); }
</style>
